  "Scope": "Only PCRE2 Boolean dispatch is split: existing plain backtracking/literal/character arms avoid a roughly12KiB shared frame. Same original budget, validator, matchers, captures, loans, token and deadline; Core DLLs identical. Ten equal-result public IsMatch cases include actual subroutine/negative conditional/ACCEPT cases, finite-live/deadline-live, backreference/literal/character and proven cached URI specialization bypassing the edited dispatcher. Optional compiled predecoded/decode-then .NET lanes only for equal overlapping semantics, explicit exclusions otherwise. Finite MatchLimit1M/Depth1024/Heap1MiB/Result1MiB; deadline1second. Warm1.5s/min64calls, independent60ms calibration, five alternating samples each\u003E=20ms; batches checked after timing. Default tiering/PGO, CPU2, one120s cap, at most one selected confirmation. No public parity/Status inferred from this producer A/B; native row refresh is separate. No new executor, policy, field, mode or unchecked access; no package/fullcatalog campaign.",
